# Embedding Term Similarity and Inverse Document Frequency into a Logical Model of Information Retrieval.

**Authors:** Losada, David E., Barreiro, Alvaro

## Abstract
Proposes an approach to incorporate term similarity and inverse document frequency into a logical model of information retrieval. Highlights include document representation and matching; incorporating term similarity into the measure of distance; new algorithms for implementation; inverse document frequency; and logical versus classical models of information retrieval. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ671857

